      <section class=3D"article-info">
        <div class=3D"article-content">
          <div class=3D"article-body"><p><span style=3D"font-weight: 400;">=
Some of Fandom's features can be enabled and disabled by local admins using=
 <strong><a href=3D"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Admin_Dashboard"=
 target=3D"_self" rel=3D"undefined">Admin Dashboard</a></strong> on that wi=
ki, such as:</span></p>
<ul>
<li>Requiring all contributors to log in
</li>
<li>
<strong><a href=3D"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Message_Wall" tar=
get=3D"_self">Message Wall</a></strong>
</li>
<li>
<a href=3D"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Comments" target=3D"_self=
" rel=3D"undefined"><strong>Article Comments</strong></a>
</li>
<li><strong><a href=3D"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Blogs" target=
=3D"_self">Blogs</a></strong></li>
</ul>
<p><span style=3D"font-weight: 400;">If you are an admin, click on "Admin" =
on your bottom toolbar to find this page.<br></span></p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p><span style=3D"font-weight: 400;">To request an interlanguage link pleas=
e see <strong><a href=3D"https://support.fandom.com/hc/en-us/articles/36003=
5267334-I-want-to-set-up-an-interlanguage-link" target=3D"_self" rel=3D"und=
efined">this help desk article</a></strong>.</span></p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p><span style=3D"font-weight: 400;">For other features and extensions, suc=
h as the following, you may need assistance:</span><span style=3D"font-weig=
ht: 400;"><br></span></p>
<ul>
<li>
<span style=3D"font-weight: 400;">Turning on&#160;</span><span style=3D"fon=
t-weight: 400;"><strong><a href=3D"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:C=
ommunity_CSS_and_JS#JavaScript" target=3D"_self">custom JavaScript</a></str=
ong> editing</span><span style=3D"font-weight: 400;">&#160;</span><span sty=
le=3D"font-weight: 400;">on for your wiki.</span>
<ul>
<li><em><span style=3D"font-weight: 400;">Note: <strong><a href=3D"https://=
community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Including_additional_CSS_and_JS#ImportJS">Im=
portJS</a></strong> does not require this to be enabled.</span></em></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<span style=3D"font-weight: 400;">Enabling </span><strong><a href=3D"https:=
//community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Achievements" target=3D"_self">achievement=
s (aka badges)</a></strong>.</li>
<li>Other extensions <strong><a href=3D"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/H=
elp:Extensions#Available_on_request" target=3D"_self">listed here</a></stro=
ng>, such as DPL or Variables.</li>
</ul>
<p>If your wiki has Fandom team contact assigned,&#160;please ask them for =
assistance. Otherwise, <strong><a href=3D"https://support.fandom.com/hc/en-=
us/requests/new?ticket_form_id=3D360000931354&tf_360017817454=3Di_want_a_fe=
ature_or_extension_turned_on" target=3D"_self" rel=3D"undefined">click here=
</a></strong> to contact us for these extensions.</p></div>

